        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Basque month names don't copy Latin; nearly all of them come from farm work or the weather. *Uztaila* comes from *uzta* (harvest), *urria* from *urri* (scarce, as supplies run low), *otsaila* from *otso* (wolf — the month when wolves came down to the villages)."
